  "title": "Integra Announces Results from Near-Mine Oxide Gold Drilling at Florida Canyon, including 138 Metres at 0.32 g/t Au and 128 Metres at 0.36 g/t Au,Highlighting Near-Mine Growth and Mine Life Extension Potential - Integra Resources",
